--- !u!114 &833757283
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 833757276}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ea768deea00c4ad4ea64024f2e793b0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueInteractable
  npcName: Forensic Officer
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a81b12db4e82af6408ef8f65944fe761, type: 3}
  playerName: ' Detective Frankcesca'
  playerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b546e4e70991f2a40b0236cb2d06ab65, type: 3}
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: ' You''re the Bureau investigator?

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f5c1c2721f3200b4695ea89bfcdbacea, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: " Yes, that's me. What have you found?\r\n "
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8714a0d9b6be74c438b7455527f6b13d, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    text: ' Alright, then. Frank Clifford been dead approximately fifteen to sixteen
      hours, so the death happened between around seven to eight PM. No sign of forced
      entry. No defensive injuries. No evidence of a struggle. His implant is the
      cause of death



'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ae3888b58c5038f4ba4803d3119c4ec7, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: 
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'He accessed it himself?

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ba562a734dc0534db19f5d414c7f5c1, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    text: ' Looks like it. The maintenance interface was manually opened. Neural
      safeguards were disabled from the local interface, then the implant was overloaded.
      It was a neural shutdown that killed him.

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7638b96fc116a5c4486e15a9ebc042dd, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: Any indication someone else was involved?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bf3538bdf2ab9e74e9813348390276f0, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    text: ' Nothing we''ve found. His apartment security logs are clean. No unauthorised
      entries.No unusual network activity around the time of death. Everything points
      in the same direction. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9742c3a8ada57884b96a6a6dbd94e993, type: 3}
  - speaker: 0
    text: '



'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: ' Suicide.

'
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ce71313162792549aca692c8a0aa7b1, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'That''s our assessment. You can take another look if you want, but I wouldn''t
      expect surprises. '
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eb1c49d1d3cad97478a02c9aa1c18aff, type: 3}
